title AVG-09 Issue and Revoke Service Cert
participant Zetrix_Registry_Admin
participant AVG
participant SSIVC
participant MBI
participant Zetrix_Registry
==ISSUE ON APPROVAL==
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->SSIVC:issue Service Cert (subject = service did:zid, approver = registry controller)
SSIVC->MBI:issue VC with Service Cert template
MBI-->SSIVC:Service Cert ID, validUntil (issue + 12 months)
SSIVC-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:Service Cert ID, validUntil
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Zetrix_Registry:add Service Cert ID to listing
==REVOKE ON SUSPEND OR DELIST==
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:block service first
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->SSIVC:revoke Service Cert
SSIVC->MBI:revoke VC
MBI-->SSIVC:revoked (status on Zetrix chain)
SSIVC-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:revoked
==REACTIVATE OR RENEW (30 DAYS BEFORE EXPIRY)==
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->SSIVC:issue new Service Cert
SSIVC->MBI:issue VC with Service Cert template
MBI-->SSIVC:new Service Cert ID
SSIVC-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:new Service Cert ID (on renewal, old cert revoked)
alt ISSUE OR RENEWAL FAILS
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:service stays Active in AVG; issue / renewal failed, Retry
end
alt REVOKE FAILS
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:service stays blocked in AVG; revoke failed, Retry
end
